# tests/ownership.rs::edit_disjoint_callback_views_reject_every_retaining_boundary, migrated to the implicit-copy
# ownership model (Compiler/JetSema/Source/Sema/Ownership/CopySites.jet). o1-o3 keep the lent view past its callback and
